{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Junkyard Builder</strong>, you\u2019re the proud owner of a once-forgotten junkyard, now brimming with endless potential. Dive into the satisfying world of restoration, recycling, and raw hustle as you transform trash into treasure and rise to become the ruler of the junk empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udc8eHunt for Treasure:</strong> Drive to new locations and explore the world for rare finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/6e4536a8bd2a6d346ca942d7ef4f4727.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/6e4536a8bd2a6d346ca942d7ef4f4727.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/6e4536a8bd2a6d346ca942d7ef4f4727.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcc8\ud83d\udd27Make Money &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Make the most of the items you find and earn money to level up your skills, buy the machines, and unlock better tools to streamline your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/84333c1ec0855075f72f26a346d19ba4.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/84333c1ec0855075f72f26a346d19ba4.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/84333c1ec0855075f72f26a346d19ba4.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f\u2728Process Trash:</strong> Process the junk to make it more valuable. Every bit counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/3fe008e12bbb5d7506f092580829b8f9.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/3fe008e12bbb5d7506f092580829b8f9.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/3fe008e12bbb5d7506f092580829b8f9.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d\ud83d\udce6\ud83d\udcb0Find Rare Items:</strong> Search the junk for valuable items like money or gold bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/0295c88d9a37e6f8320bf35bdd3123aa.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/0295c88d9a37e6f8320bf35bdd3123aa.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/0295c88d9a37e6f8320bf35bdd3123aa.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83d\ude97\ud83e\ude91Restore &amp; Renovate:</strong> Bring old, rusty items back to life\u2014whether it\u2019s an old car or dilapidated furniture, your skills can make them valuable again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/016f2d292debc1183f96b2acda13b151.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/016f2d292debc1183f96b2acda13b151.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/016f2d292debc1183f96b2acda13b151.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f\u2699\ufe0f\ud83d\ude9cMaster the Machines:</strong> Operate powerful tools and machinery, from tower cranes to scrap presses that can crush entire cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/443717070599c3041c87315461f77d59.poster.avif?t=1773857449\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/443717070599c3041c87315461f77d59.webm?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/443717070599c3041c87315461f77d59.mp4?t=1773857449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb0\ud83d\udce6\ud83e\udd1eTry Your Luck:</strong> Spend your hard-earned cash on mystery containers and uncover the surprises hidden inside. Will you strike it rich or find nothing but junk?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your work gloves, fire up the machines, and get ready to rake in the profits\u2014because in this junkyard, one person\u2019s trash is your ticket to wealth. Build your junk empire and become the king of scrap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339330/extras/864eee2bb468e31f18cdfa41d2283ecc.avif?t=1773857449\" width=1080 height=3840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Metal Junk King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/861a27773653fc2c6ec58279550e91a6429b5589.jpg"},{"name":"Paper Junk King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/0079f8045e9ebd9eb94a3774695d6228c59c7828.jpg"},{"name":"Plastic Junk King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/858f7d691af65d279a04c4d71f9e896581cdae82.jpg"},{"name":"Mixed Junk King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/17a06968c3c0e63c9a37c25843b111f5e3586415.jpg"},{"name":"Scrap Block Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/3e10473da2a64252e9239355fbf6ea7525b5dcdc.jpg"},{"name":"Smelting Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/9ddd2463a7d24b1a6e0e5df008c80169bdc5d4a2.jpg"},{"name":"Car Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/62adf376dee8887064d66200239c0f9c21c30db1.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339330/9f19958a8db75884af6e0c726eb48a56f285487d.jpg"},{"name":"Small Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st